{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2249", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2249/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2249/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2249/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2249", "id": 2187222574, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6CXl4u", "number": 2249, "title": "Increase rx rate ", "user": {"login": "StefanoColli", "id": 45536733, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTM2NzMz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45536733?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli", "html_url": "https://github.com/StefanoColli", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/StefanoColli/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2024-03-14T20:34:26Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-20T04:12:48Z", "closed_at": "2024-05-20T04:12:48Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi,\r\nI'm trying to send a custom message at a high frequency (1kHz) to a SITL simulation running on the same machine. However, using the `mavlink status` the received message rate is 25Hz and most of the packets are lost:\r\n\r\n```\r\n instance #1:\r\n\tGCS heartbeat valid\r\n\tmavlink chan: #1\r\n\ttype:\t\tGENERIC LINK OR RADIO\r\n\tflow control: OFF\r\n\trates:\r\n\t  tx: 27988.0 B/s\r\n\t  txerr: 0.0 B/s\r\n\t  tx rate mult: 1.000\r\n\t  tx rate max: 4000000 B/s\r\n\t  rx: 28871.5 B/s\r\n\t  rx loss: 0.6%\r\n\tReceived Messages:\r\n\t  sysid:245, compid:190, Total: 13088 (lost: 7358)\r\n\t    msgid:    4, Rate:  1.4 Hz, last 0.14s ago\r\n\t    msgid:    0, Rate:  1.0 Hz, last 0.16s ago\r\n\t    msgid:  446, Rate: 25.0 Hz, last 0.00s ago\r\n\tFTP enabled: YES, TX enabled: YES\r\n\tmode: Onboard\r\n\tMAVLink version: 2\r\n\ttransport protocol: UDP (14580, remote port: 14540)\r\n\tBroadcast enabled: NO\r\n\tpartner IP: 127.0.0.1\r\n\tping statistics:\r\n\t  last: 0.00 ms\r\n\t  mean: 0.00 ms\r\n\t  max: 0.00 ms\r\n\t  min: 0.00 ms\r\n\t  dropped packets: 0\r\n```\r\nIs there a way to increase the rate at which the messages are sent to/received by PX4?", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_u